# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
# What the source distribution carries besides the package (src/setuhq) and pyproject.toml.
# The stored runs, the site, the results, the README figures, caches and the test suite stay in the
# repository: they are data or need it, and tests/test_release.py checks that none of them reach a dist.
include README.md README.pypi.md CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff codemeta.json
include LICENSE LICENSING.md NOTICE TRADEMARKS.md
prune tests
prune runs
prune site
prune docs
prune cache
prune data
prune tools
prune scripts
prune examples
prune configs
prune paper
